  "notes": "USAGE:\nMost commonly seen in {賛助|さんじょ}{会員|かいいん} (supporting member/associate member), a common membership category in Japanese organizations where members provide financial support without full voting rights.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {賛助|さんじょ}{会員|かいいん} (supporting member)\n- {賛助|さんじょ}{金|きん} (sponsorship money)\n- {賛助|さんじょ}{出演|しゅつえん} (guest appearance in support)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {後援|こうえん}: patronage, backing — broader support, often for events\n- {協賛|きょうさん}: co-sponsorship — joint support, often commercial",
